        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ElSULRLonc01Kt5JdD5u-2" value="2. 각 화면에서 swipe를 하여 다음or이전 화면으로 넘어간다.&lt;br&gt;- swipe left : 시계방향 순환&lt;br&gt;- swipe right : 반시계방향 순환" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="ElSULRLonc01Kt5JdD5u-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="200" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ElSULRLonc01Kt5JdD5u-3" value="3. swipe 할 때 [Empty] 로 설정된 화면은 보여주지 않고 건너뛴다." style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="ElSULRLonc01Kt5JdD5u-0" vertex="1">
